<div class="metadata_title">Active Properties of Neocortical Pyramidal Neuron Dendrites</div>
<div class="metadata_citation">
<span>Annual Review of Neuroscience <span class="citationvolume">36</span></span><span>, 1</span><span> (2013)</span><span>; <a href="https://doi.org/10.1146/annurev-neuro-062111-150343" rel="external" class="externallink" title="undefined - opens in new window/tab" target="_blank">https://doi.org/10.1146/annurev-neuro-062111-150343</a></span>
